:        ll_ok_   = c_ll_.open(PERF_TYPE_HW_CACHE, cache_cfg(PERF_COUNT_HW_CACHE_LL, PERF_COUNT_HW_CACHE_OP_READ,\n205:                                                            PERF_COUNT_HW_CACHE_RESULT_MISS));\n206:        dtlb_ok_ = c_dtlb_.open(PERF_TYPE_HW_CACHE, cache_cfg(PERF_COUNT_HW_CACHE_DTLB, PERF_COUNT_HW_CACHE_OP_READ,\n207:                                                              PERF_COUNT_HW_CACHE_RESULT_MISS));\n208:        // L2 + coherence_invalidations: KEIN portabler generischer Counter → bewusst NICHT geöffnet, Feld 0.\n266:                c.cache_misses_l3 = v;\n286:                // Wraparound: + max_energy_range_uj (modular), sonst best-effort 0.\n292:            c.energy_micro_joules = delta_uj;\n295:        // L2 + coherence_invalidations bleiben EHRLICH 0 (kein portabler generischer Counter).\n350:            c.cache_misses_l3 = static_cast<std::uint64_t>(vals[1] < 0 ? 0 : vals[1]);","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"2d8ab41b-aad2-4cf1-99db-7e1fe5ea7077","timestamp":"2026-08-06T18:26:07.048Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"5:// liefert die +6 HW-Counter (cache_misses L1/LL, dtlb, best-effort L2/coherence, RAPL-energy) aus echten\n27:// PERF_TYPE_HW_CACHE config = id | (op<<8) | (result<<16); self-monitoring pid=0,cpu=-1; attr.exclude_kernel=1\n65:/// PERF_TYPE_HW_CACHE config-Kodierung (man7): config = cache_id | (op_id<<8) | (result_id<<16).\n152:/// best-effort RAPL-Paket-Energie über /sys/class/powercap/intel-rapl:0/energy_uj (bereits in Mikrojoule;\n153:/// keine scale-Rechnung). KEIN perf nötig. Seit Linux 5.10 oft 0400 (root-only) → non-root liest -1 → energy\n154:/// bleibt 0/available=false. Wraparound via max_energy_range_uj wird zwischen begin()/end() berücksichtigt.\n156:    std::FILE* f = std::fopen(\"/sys/class/powercap/intel-rapl:0/energy_uj\", \"rb\");\n171:    std::FILE* f = std::fopen(\"/sys/class/powercap/intel-rapl:0/max_energy_range_uj\", \"rb\");\n191:///   cache_misses_l1         <- PERF_COUNT_HW_CACHE_L1D / OP_READ / R